# Empty means "same origin": API calls go to /api/... on whatever host the app
# is served from. In dev the Vite proxy forwards those to the Go server; in prod
# the Go server serves the built SPA itself. Keeping this relative is what lets
# the SameSite=Lax auth cookie survive (127.0.0.1 and localhost are different
# sites, so an absolute host here silently breaks auth).
PUBLIC_API_URL=
